              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno okwanyo okayo pere m'oyido ripo lunjo jo paka kere, to miyo paka cowirok ri were ma Mowab i wi kor ot ma tindi madwoŋ. Joisiraili jobwok aka jogik wok i tindi madwoŋ to jodok i piny pajo.",
